# oracle: kspace_style msm order 8, mesh 8 8 8, cutoff/adjust no, with all boundaries f f f (no periodic images: the top grid level kept and summed in full with gamma(r/(2^n a))/(2^n a), the extra grid points alpha..beta of non-periodic dimensions), pressure/scalar no, pair lj/cut/coul/msm, a rocksalt cluster of 64 ions in a 34 A box, NVE, 40 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 7.2e-13, atoms 2.3e-14.
units           metal
atom_style      charge
boundary        f f f
lattice         fcc 5.64
region          box block -2 4 -2 4 -2 4
create_box      2 box
region          clus block 0 1.99 0 1.99 0 1.99
create_atoms    1 region clus
lattice         fcc 5.64 origin 0.5 0.0 0.0
create_atoms    2 region clus
mass            1 22.99
mass            2 35.45
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
variable        dx atom 0.12*sin(0.53*x+0.21*y)
variable        dy atom 0.12*cos(0.37*y-0.19*z)
variable        dz atom 0.12*sin(0.29*z+0.41*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 300.0 87287 dist gaussian
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/msm 7.0
pair_coeff      1 1 0.0100 2.35
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0050 4.40
pair_coeff      1 2 0.0070 3.00
kspace_style    msm 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   order 8 pressure/scalar no cutoff/adjust no mesh 8 8 8
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
